# The repo-root .gitignore excludes `*.json` (and `*.txt`) as "large data files".
# These fixtures are neither: they are the FROZEN reference vectors that pin the
# huBERT embedding space, and the whole point of them is that they live in git.
# Without this negation they would silently never be committed and
# tests/unit/test_embedding_backends.py would fail on a fresh clone.
!*.json
!*.txt
